00C5                  (            os9.d):01260         E$Up                RMB       1                   Up arrow pressed on SCF I$ReadLn with PD.UP enabled
00C6                  (            os9.d):01261         E$Dn                RMB       1                   Down arrow pressed on SCF I$ReadLn with PD.DOWN enabled
00C7                  (            os9.d):01262         E$Alias             RMB       1
